The review is not accepting this cycle. Two invariants are missing: directory identity does not cover the root directory’s own mode, and plan validation permits overlapping live target namespaces. Both can make the engine treat changed or non-independent state as a valid target. I’m recording the evidence before routing the task to implementation rework.
